  "limits": [
    "No RUN instruction, application build, dependency installation, image tag, registry push or application startup was performed. BuildKit may retain its normal build cache.",
    "Exact exported regular-file count/bytes exclude symlinks as documented by the embedded verifier. Reported BuildKit MB values are rounded and are not exact receipt bytes.",
    "Git size growth and this local context proof do not establish how much deployment delay was caused by documentation, nor the final image size.",
    "Host cache exclusions do not remove caches created by RUN during image builds. Bun installer cache size and physical hardlink duplication were not measured; no Dockerfile cache cleanup is claimed.",
    "Root-only documentation/tool exclusions preserve package-level assets and checked required inputs. The proof checks those inputs, not every possible application dependency."
